  "content": {
    "title": "Fotor Agent能做带MG动画的商业视频和自媒体视频，效果顶还便宜",
    "user_name": "gh_426cd27710df",
    "nick_name": "洛洛AI说",
    "create_time": "2026-10-20 16:56",
    "content_noencode": "<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">洛洛的第40篇原创文章</span></span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">大家好，我是洛洛。</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">这两年的 AI 视频赛道，主流AI视频模型大多在死磕生成视频片段的逼真度和电影感。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">但好看的片段仅仅只是起点。做商业视频、自媒体视频等内容时，要想兼顾视觉质感与信息传递，动态数据图表、数字标签、文字动效等MG动画元素必不可少。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">下面先分享一段Fotor Agent官方的MG动画的科普视频。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4745859190571614209\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4745859190571614209\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FsmYNP8B0KCndwnbD09YBib0s5uyAPJzyicWd54OBWwHL9fwzQMRr0GgmjK5xFfDBYKum9JpiaOG7jXTqE3KmF9TSiaLOxHtFDy41bKdEherLahI%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.7777777777777777\" data-w=\"1280\"></iframe></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KClmt1KIpTjETSwMQjGUBVh9XkQZlCxnqG4sKOiamh4SibXmsg8LwSAQnpS9ecGDr4vWZNttynddNJNheS4msIEJUQHLAIODgqBLQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.1509259\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100004826\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">什么是MG动画</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">简单来说，</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">MG 动画就是动态图形和动效。</span></span><span leaf=\"\">做带MG动画的视频，</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">核心是把文字、图标、数据等这类视觉元素，按照叙事逻辑做成动态效果，合理准确的添加至原有视频中。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在产品特写展示、品牌宣传片、新品发布演示、技术架构讲解、数据可视化播报、大型展会巨幕投放、知识科普内容等多元视频场景中，</span></span><span leaf=\"\">经常会用到这类MG动画效果。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmKlYia2xBJP6AO6mUxhrQDicia7tMfOhZ9SrvPOMxzf2LG8tFgxYNcRe9REKrJRstyLpG6OEb3PuXTbpaMpqTxF9ic9uaDe1TDA6I/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562963\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100004828\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">以前像做这种MG动画，需要靠AE去“手搓”，满屏的图层和关键帧，门</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">槛高、耗时长，价格也不低，改稿更是能让人崩溃。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">那用现在很火的常规 AI 视频模型来做呢？也很头疼。 生成的是一体化的固定像素画面，一旦遇到 MG 动画里大量需要的文字、数字和图表，很容易就生成一堆乱码，说实话用AI视频模型去做这类带MG动画的商业视频和自媒体视频还有一定距离。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">直到最近我发现了Fotor Agent这款产品，</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">它采用AI驱动的“代码生成视频”技术路线，用户只需要用自然语言描述清楚需求，就能利用AI编写代码，然后用代码直接生成高质量的MG动画。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Fotor Agent在制作 MG 动画时，优势也非常直观明显：</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCkr6pmiccfHmbibI29aNCgmYd2tG6jvt8nHVVCeuo6Axibz0Q4RRpIzojGJkOZr0AdtNRSVDg3GicyDJOGx2TLkRKMUlkaicqY6mtX8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562963\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100004829\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">文字、数据、图表等生成稳定不会乱码；原生支持原生 4K高清导出；就算不会 AE 的新手，也能轻松上手操作；即便生成后也能进行针对性的精准调整，</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">而不像AI视频模型生成的那样——即便只修改一处文字也要整个片段重新抽卡生成。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">据了解，Fotor Agent是由Fotor团队全力打造的AI视频创作工具，采用了全新的“代码生成视频”技术路线，</span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">其早在 8 月就在海外上线，时间要比现在海外爆火的Opus上线还要早，</span></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">当时上线即拿下 Product Hunt 当日最佳产品榜第一，现在Fotor又在国内率先将这条“代码生成视频”技术路线落地应用，让国内用户也能轻松高效地制作MG动画了。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Fotor Agent不仅能够直出原生4K高清MG动画，而且也非常适合做这类带MG动画的商业视频及自媒体视频。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">下面我试着做了两个实测，并挑选了两个官方展出的案例，带大家感受一下这款国产视频制作“神器”——Fotor Agent“代码生成视频”的真实实力。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCkYYcoyzhiaKnVlWCVxIAbLjMEu38Q3FsK0YVs1uGruvw8ricrvnO9Tb2enrAQA59RmXq612KJLHSV3gMFGFQWGhIdwicsfI9kg0c/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.15\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100004827\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;font-size: 20px;letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">MG动画宠物玩具广告</span></strong></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">做宠物种草短视频，很流行动物实拍搭配 MG 动画，用动态图表展示产品参数，铲屎官一眼就能看懂。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">看看 Fotor Agent 能不能把居家实拍视频和 MG 动画融合到位，直接产出能商用的电商短片。我先上传了参考图片，然后用自然语言描述了具体要求。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCkt5vB8JtGpeyMfTNspoFvytLQS8tT2ze31qTs7yVgyibwCDyrxCEA5rYlPepVVO9ibCGj1ej8qQUibSDjiaiaoLlNvriaPLhOZSjibLU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4777778\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100004832\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Fotor Agent 自带长时序推理与规划能力，</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">用自然语言描述需求，就能自动推理和解析项目意图，一次性产出所有视频画面、MG动画、配音配乐、字幕转场等，</span></span><span leaf=\"\">并且所有素材会自动排布对齐到多轨道，</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">省去手动逐帧对齐，也不用来回切换各类工具，实现完整的创作闭环。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Fotor Agent生成的是可再次编辑的视频工程文件，</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">所有视频轨道元素彼此独立，</span></span><span leaf=\"\">假如需要修改，</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">我几乎能够针对每一个视频元素进行针对性的调整，不用整条片子重新渲染生成。</span></span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCl4AKMN1B7St3MPvvxzbpIOSLqHcDicoSvT8rkWlyMu0hHtwMChBsClnVkYwFac6rrkIKrBsloU7qoe8dYgwrzVYsfiarEB1VOk8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4777778\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100004830\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Fotor Agent生成的宠物玩具视频，画面搭配 MG 图表融合得很自然连贯，兼顾宠物动态、产品细节和数据图表，十分契合这类宠物种草短片的创作需求，成片可直接发短视频平台。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4745865793245282308\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4745865793245282308\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FsmYNP8B0KClOogHDnfFVYMAkzYLl1P8Hl6ibibDyibB2gLZ68j0X169zcwlg41x9foqiapWrZxbzOVpAYMAEibsSCK4EdyKeicjTV7YZumwQIF65M%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-w=\"1080\"></iframe></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: left;letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">秋日养护科普MG动画</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">做知识科普类视频，的的确确MG 动画是不可或缺的好帮手，很多知识类科普博主都有这类需求。</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">但普通 AI 视频模型很难生成文字、图标、数据等精准呈现的内容，</span></span><span leaf=\"\">这次使用Fotor Agent,我还是直接用自然语言描述了具体需求，让 Fotor Agent 来生成科普 MG 动画。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCndPq2flpgn2DqLPPL5pQs9fDTRicIV7Qakp4QSiaeIiaRwL827ccYn5g1CMrOnXOmYPicTc04BVmIutJOU1TAVX7lNn1uC4tjmF2k/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4777778\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100004831\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">成片的视觉效果真的惊艳到我，整套画风统一治愈，拉近了这类知识科普内容和观众的距离。</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">信息展示直观清晰，文字没有乱码，而且还支持 4K 输出，动画节奏完美贴合旁白。</span></span><span leaf=\"\">不用会 AE，自然语言就能直接出片，省去大量手动调动画的人力与时间，</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">成本更低，做起来省心很多。</span></span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCnGeq9ZtSaUxM9UXGVd5EkZBgziciadRGFud1D0emdFYCY2Ik40ksVeuhYFK39xwShmFF769ibnFnnnicaT0uvysyBbh6Ah3zBLW4Y/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6018519\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100004833\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">MG 动画元素支持精细化单独编辑，改动局部不会触发整段重绘。</span></span><span leaf=\"\">多轨道编辑操作简单流畅，既能直接在画面上调整元素，也能在参数面板修改。不用整条视频重新渲染，修改起来也很高效顺手。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4745869839272099840\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4745869839272099840\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FsmYNP8B0KClZwNfe8rgtEuUXGHo92Czg0ibMXZa5jm8VGvibjia1dKBOdDEAliaSBJ45lmjTJqrgW6ciaqamst5qzCYLIeFrWibslygWvyHiaMichxE%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.637037037037037\" data-w=\"1768\"></iframe></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">这类信息可视化的MG动画，就是帮大家轻松看懂知识点，让内容生动不枯燥。</span></span><span leaf=\"\">现在普通人也能用很低的成本做出AE水准的专业科普MG动画，成片直接就能发到社交平台做科普传播。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4745871734510419977\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4745871734510419977\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FsmYNP8B0KCkSCqzQGwRrwca05eUKYcFU2s8tENtyEHFicuUxTgqwvRZWe3xUhQKk96pErrgHAZN8b0Ojpogl8UCQ4Yql87FzanpvtibLAkgy4%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.7777777777777777\" data-w=\"1920\"></iframe></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">再来看看官网分享的两组不同赛道的案例，感受下它在更多场景下的创作表现。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">国风内容现在很受欢迎，大家偏爱有电影质感、带着人文气息的城市文化短片。这支短片把实景画面和国风 MG 动态 UI、特色转场融合在一起，用来做城市文旅宣传挺不错的。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4745874570832969732\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4745874570832969732\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FsmYNP8B0KCkHiczJr3tBOdETG0FMwRfGkU5aQAdJgMuIT1ib9ZMibibgQIk8v71k6dXDBtOJBS4dIyeZf5nATHyEico9sQk4nbtKGS8oF1A3AUro%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.7777777777777777\" data-w=\"1920\"></iframe></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">这种展现虚拟产品亮点的创意短片，各类 IP、潮玩还有品牌创意宣传都能用上。画面层次干净，镜头节奏利落，胶片颗粒、滚动字幕的质感统一，局部内容可以单独调整，适合做创意宣发短片。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4745887942055968774\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4745887942055968774\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FsmYNP8B0KCnwE8onwcrqvGBBtJuFONia1bQGBldhRVhJNkohocUN6uFMOZdFa6ZvvnpcYoN6YjocezrlZzbRibQRKff5YkD6GicgBHPSmicYQxg%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.7777777777777777\" data-w=\"1920\"></iframe></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCniaibCLL4l8y1TRPloxaz1n5TSdjia8eFUnd9MxznaG9pALZiav0iayABQic2D9icQ76ZGppzURZd4PJU5VjSFpaUc0zxCibkFWNMt9Z4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.15\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100004835\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">洛洛有话说</span></b></span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">看完这些案例，</span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">能发现</span></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Fotor Agent能搞定不少场景。不管是创作什么类型的视频作品，直接用文字讲清楚想法，就能落地创意。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">就算没有视频制作基础，也能轻松做出原生4K高清MG动画，以及带 MG 动画的长视频内容。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"backg